{"id":"en_the-christmas-eve-unraveling","title":"The Christmas Eve Unraveling","titleEn":"The Christmas Eve Unraveling","description":"A single text sent to the wrong person exposes a secret Aubrey's father has kept for fourteen years: a mistress and a son, supported with the family's savings. Rather than stay silent, Aubrey joins forces with her mother and a determined divorce lawyer to gather evidence, secure the family's assets, and bring the hidden betrayal into public view. Piece by piece, the lies are laid bare, and the man responsible is held accountable for what he has done. The series follows Aubrey's fight to protect her family and see justice served, and viewers can follow it on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-christmas-eve-unraveling/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-christmas-eve-unraveling/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Betrayal","Strong Female Lead","Dominant","Love Triangle","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dn5jc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-christmas-eve-unraveling_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dn5jc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-christmas-eve-unraveling_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dn5jc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-christmas-eve-unraveling_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dn5jc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-christmas-eve-unraveling_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"source